                    </div>

                    <p id="txt-doc-terms-intro" class="text-sm">By accessing or using the Note by Note platform, you agree to be bound by these legal terms and conditions.</p>

                    <div>
                        <h3 id="txt-tos1-title" class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-2">1. Booking and Cancellation Policy</h3>
                        <p id="txt-tos1-desc" class="text-sm text-slate-600">Sessions may be canceled or rescheduled up to 24 hours prior to the scheduled start time without penalty. Late cancellations or missed sessions may forfeit session credits.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h3 id="txt-tos2-title" class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-2">2. Mentorship Fees &amp; Payments</h3>
                        <p id="txt-tos2-desc" class="text-sm text-slate-600">All fees are processed through secure payment gateways on Note by Note. Direct payments between mentors and mentees outside the platform are strictly prohibited.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h3 id="txt-tos3-title" class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base mb-2">3. Account Termination</h3>
                        <p id="txt-tos3-desc" class="text-sm text-slate-600">Note by Note reserves the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate our Code of Conduct or compromise platform safety.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

